# Station (live server): an avatar emote from the chat panel's Emote tab at room 1's home spot. In a starbase the
# tab lists the avatar's emotes (ui_chat_panel.cpp's 0xB7C398); an item (0x569A00) runs its command through the
# avatar's NLP into the chat stream and sends it as AVATAR_EMOTE; the avatar bows. Shot while the animation plays.
name: starbase avatar emote: Emote tab, Bow
timeout: 200
include _sb_home
click gadget chat.tab.emote
alive 0.5
shot emote_list
# the third item, 'Bow' (items from y 68, about 23.4 px apart)
click gadget emote.bow
expect-event antprox 'received AVATAR_EMOTE$' within 10
# the server's AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE (opcode 95, cpacket.cpp's MESSAGE_CHATSTREAM 0x736F10) plays the stream on the
# avatar: retail loads the bow's animation (avatar 6, male: ABANIM00-46) right after it
expect-event antprox 'sent AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE' within 10
expect-event proxy 'AMDEFAULTSKEL\.ABANIM00-46' within 5
alive 1
shot emote_bow
alive 5
# 'Wave' (/handwave), item 23
click gadget chat.tab.emote
alive 0.5
click 720,583
expect-event antprox 'received AVATAR_EMOTE$' within 10
expect-event antprox 'sent AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE' within 10
alive 1
shot emote_wave
alive 5
# 'Salute', item 30
click gadget chat.tab.emote
alive 0.5
click 720,747
expect-event antprox 'received AVATAR_EMOTE$' within 10
expect-event antprox 'sent AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE' within 10
alive 1
shot emote_salute
alive 5
